# Satellite Image Download Script

## Objective
To collect and prepare multi-temporal Landsat satellite imagery for shoreline change analysis in the Meghna Estuary, Bangladesh.

## Satellite Data
- Landsat 8 Collection 2 Level-2
- Landsat 9 Collection 2 Level-2 (for the 2025 composite)

## Study Period
- 2015: November 2015 – February 2016
- 2020: November 2020 – February 2021
- 2025: November 2025 – February 2026

## Processing
1. Filtering satellite images by date and study area.
2. Cloud and cloud-shadow masking.
3. Surface reflectance scaling.
4. Median composite generation.
5. Clipping images to the study area.
6. Exporting GeoTIFF images to Google Drive.

## Output
Three multi-temporal satellite composites for shoreline extraction and subsequent shoreline change analysis.

## Platform
Google Earth Engine (GEE)
